# Cloudflare API token: a live secret with DNS and API-token scope.
# relay/.env holds the copy the tooling reads; this is the original paste.
CF Jobby Mobilemonero.txt

# Credential backups of relay/.env. Each holds 23-26 live keys
# (Supabase service role, OpenRouter, Resend) and was untracked AND
# unignored, so a git add -A at the root would have committed them.
relay/.env.bak*
local-supabase/.env


# The relay server lives in xmrtdao/mobilemonero, which is where the canonical copy is
# committed. This repo tracked a partial, stale copy of it - 3,490 lines against the
# running 16,184 - and its own README lists relay/ as local-only. Ignored rather
# than deleted: the working copy is what actually runs and must keep working.
relay/server.js

# Runtime JSON state written by the relay (task lists, activity log, session state).
# It changes on every request and is not source.
relay/relay-data/
